# w3_l1b "Blizzard Pass" (Expert) side path: the frozen pond crossed on its ice floes instead of through the
# secret grotto. tests/test_campaign_routes.gd plays tools/autoplay/routes/w3_l1b.expert.inputs up to its "# B4" comment,
# then this file: the hero lands on the ice shore just before the fifth gust (peak 72).
# Brace through the gust, then use the whole lull: land running and re-jump at each edge (the lull wind of 16 cuts
# every jump to about 50 px, so a stop on a floe costs the run-up).
90:D
17:R,18:RU,16:R,18:RU,16:R,18:RU,40:
